WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.952 --> 00:00:16.598
The morning a crowd gathered around the statue.

2
00:00:18.098 --> 00:00:20.619
The people had warm clothes and enough food.

3
00:00:23.341 --> 00:00:27.182
But many were still complaining about the statue's appearance.

4
00:00:27.202 --> 00:00:31.384
"Our beautiful statue is ugly now!"

5
00:00:32.976 --> 00:00:36.079
"We must catch the thief who stole his gold and jewels!"

6
00:00:36.099 --> 00:00:39.082
"Catch the thief!"

7
00:00:39.682 --> 00:00:41.003
people chanted together.

8
00:00:41.023 --> 00:00:43.726
"Catch the thief!"

9
00:00:45.587 --> 00:00:47.929
The mayor clapped to get everyone's attention.

10
00:00:47.949 --> 00:00:51.052
"Yes, we must catch the thief.

11
00:00:53.074 --> 00:00:56.897
But the king must not see what happened to his beautiful statue."

12
00:00:57.778 --> 00:00:59.099
The mayor drew in a breath.

13
00:01:00.624 --> 00:01:03.246
"So we will tear it down!"

14
00:01:03.266 --> 00:01:08.510
"Yes!" the people cheered.

15
00:01:11.712 --> 00:01:14.154
Swallow was too weak and cold to lift his head.

16
00:01:15.715 --> 00:01:17.937
But he could hear everything the people were saying.

17
00:01:20.339 --> 00:01:21.660
He chirped softly.

18
00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:27.144
"This statue gave away his beauty to make your lives better!

19
00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:30.441
And now you will tear him down?

20
00:01:31.842 --> 00:01:33.763
Shame on all of you!"

21
00:01:36.285 --> 00:01:39.687
But of course, reader, the townspeople could not hear Swallow.

22
00:01:41.828 --> 00:01:43.630
Only the statue could hear these words.

23
00:01:46.471 --> 00:01:48.573
Soon everyone drifted off.

24
00:01:50.214 --> 00:01:53.516
The townspeople were pleased that the bare statue would be torn down.

25
00:01:56.252 --> 00:01:59.413
No longer would it stain their town with its ugliness.

26
00:02:04.176 --> 00:02:07.317
you for speaking up, Swallow," the statue said.

27
00:02:07.337 --> 00:02:11.059
"But please, save your strength.

28
00:02:12.139 --> 00:02:13.700
You need it to get healthy."

29
00:02:16.001 --> 00:02:17.561
Swallow closed his eyes.

30
00:02:17.581 --> 00:02:22.063
"I'm afraid that is not my fate, Prince.

31
00:02:23.264 --> 00:02:26.049
I—" Screech!

32
00:02:26.069 --> 00:02:30.794
"So it was you who did this to the statue!"

33
00:02:33.896 --> 00:02:35.918
Swallow peeled open his eyes again.

34
00:02:35.938 --> 00:02:40.882
The hungry-looking hawk sat on one of the statue's shoulders!

35
00:02:43.285 --> 00:02:46.187
"You got me at last," Swallow said.

36
00:02:46.207 --> 00:02:51.272
"Yes, I'm the one who took away the statue's beauty.

37
00:02:53.152 --> 00:02:55.134
I'm too weak to fly away now.

38
00:02:56.575 --> 00:02:58.616
So go ahead, eat me."

39
00:03:02.399 --> 00:03:03.179
listen to him!"

40
00:03:03.520 --> 00:03:04.480
the statue cried.

41
00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:06.762
"I asked him to do it!"

42
00:03:09.364 --> 00:03:11.626
The hawk eyed the statue.

43
00:03:11.646 --> 00:03:14.107
"Why would you do that?"

44
00:03:14.127 --> 00:03:20.212
"Because from up here I see all the unhappiness in the land.

45
00:03:26.368 --> 00:03:28.750
I had to do something to help people.

46
00:03:29.831 --> 00:03:32.552
And so, I asked Swallow to help me."

47
00:03:37.136 --> 00:03:38.677
The hawk screeched again.

48
00:03:38.697 --> 00:03:41.839
"I cannot believe you did that!"

49
00:03:41.859 --> 00:03:45.261
"Well, I did!"

50
00:03:45.582 --> 00:03:46.442
the statue said.

51
00:03:46.462 --> 00:03:49.925
"Now leave my dear friend alone.

52
00:03:49.945 --> 00:03:54.508
He is dying, and my heart is breaking.

53
00:03:57.072 --> 00:04:00.153
Swallow is the best friend I've ever had."

54
00:04:03.734 --> 00:04:07.416
Crack! A loud sound suddenly echoed through the air.

55
00:04:08.856 --> 00:04:11.117
Startled, the hawk flew off the statue.

56
00:04:12.997 --> 00:04:16.138
With another crack, one of the statue's arms snapped off.

57
00:04:17.019 --> 00:04:20.360
Then it fell down, sailing toward Swallow!
